BCS Master update files

1) Replace:
app/src/main/java/com/bcsmaster/app/MainActivity.kt
with MainActivity.kt

2) Replace:
app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml
with AndroidManifest.xml

3) Create folder if it does not exist:
app/src/main/res/xml/
Then add file_paths.xml there:
app/src/main/res/xml/file_paths.xml

4) app/build.gradle.kts does not need a new dependency for FileProvider;
androidx.core:core-ktx is already present.

Features:
- separate SQLite database files for each listed BCS subject
- wrong answer review in exam result
- create random 200-question PDF from selected subjects
- PDF heading: সোয়েব BCS কেয়ার
- answer key at the end
- share PDF to compatible apps; choose a print-capable app to print

Important:
- Existing bcs_master.db is retained and used for General Knowledge.
- Do not clear app data or uninstall before testing.
- Build/test has not been run in Android Studio in this session.
